 "w": 0.2772808498806424}, {"text": "2 This L", "x": 0.10554561790251878, "y": 0.7486046515403695, "w": 0.06440071529812284, "h": 0.010289752646904174}, {"y": 0.748604651487235, "text": "e is very big; in fact, it's five kilometres", "x": 0.22540250618232885, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.2647584872775608}, {"text": "across from one side to the other!", "y": 0.7624277977966127, "x": 0.1288014294714053, "w": 0.23076922946506076, "h": 0.010207581227436775}, {"h": 0.010413486776799437, "y": 0.7762758146212527, "text": "3 Ar", "x": 0.10548172208571499, "w": 0.04663941701253255}, {"y": 0.7744760341891967, "h": 0.014276928815600672, "text": "_r runs through the middle of the town", "x": 0.2055632507433804, "w": 0.2650365024142795}, {"w": 0.2504472181532118, "x": 0.12880143576537384, "h": 0.012677304366004975, "text": "and it's a popular place for kayaking.", "y": 0.790302346746324}, {"x": 0.11627906574291166, "text": "We walked up to the top of the m", "y": 0.804244186302683, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "w": 0.24329159206814235}, {"x": 0.41144901832875186, "h": 0.010116278651819414, "y": 0.8042441864240903, "w": 0.05008944193522136, "text": "n and"}, {"w": 0.2719141303168403, "x": 0.1270125279244658, "y": 0.8181540699814621, "text": "had an amazing view of the land below.", "h": 0.011408204330864305}, {"h": 0.01152689700522574, "w": 0.3631484646267361, "text": "5 I love swimming in our local pool but swimming in", "x": 0.10554562820541542, "y": 0.8319178701383122}, {"x": 0.12701252405968005, "y": 0.8472292418211289, "h": 0.009029783393501837, "w": 0.035778172810872394, "text": "the s"}, {"y": 0.845973837254718, "h": 0.011462986025999546, "w": 0.1717352294921875, "text": "a is much more exciting.", "x": 0.22003578334573692}, {"x": 0.10554562533717898, "text": "6 Lots of people come to see the w", "y": 0.8597924188739433, "h": 0.00902978339350174, "w": 0.2522361246744792}, {"y": 0.10116279099599695, "x": 0.5259391791489261, "h": 0.011513201768647938, "text": "WORD STORE 8B | Animals", "w": 0.20930231730143234}, {"text": "3 Read the descriptions and write the names", "y": 0.12131317708820274, "w": 0.32737030029296876, "h": 0.012727520483065188, "x": 0.5295169959850005}, {"y": 0.13530523265097524, "h": 0.011526897379637562, "text": "of the wildlife. Write one letter in each space.", "w": 0.32737030029296876, "x": 0.5509838997417089}, {"text": "The biggest land animal in the world. It lives in Africa", "h": 0.011449290415009921, "w": 0.3613595581054687, "x": 0.5724508067701638, "y": 0.15546931404847716}, {"h": 0.010276057410326273, "w": 0.07334526062011726, "x": 0.570661896791909, "y": 0.1707122096799043, "text": "and India."}, {"y": 0.1845109454437088, "h": 0.012867644117196965, "x": 0.5706324457314415, "w": 0.09487106323242189, "text": "elephant"}, {"text": "1", "w": 0.008944543202718092, "x": 0.5509839002009665, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.20232558168884787}, {"h": 0.011517766972311145, "y": 0.20218862812035462, "text": "It's a big animal. It can be brown, black or even white.", "x": 0.5706619120001885, "w": 0.3667262776692708}, {"y": 0.21497093028301992, "x": 0.5706618990464492, "w": 0.35420393202039935, "h": 0.012736650890391605, "text": "It can be dangerous but lots of young children have"}, {"w": 0.12764555189344617, "y": 0.228172043413631, "text": "a toy version of it.", "x": 0.5702479408743734, "h": 0.015745957663773694}, {"y": 0.261758721186404, "x": 0.565295168017132, "w": 0.35778174506293403, "text": "This is a large cat which lives in Asia. It's got orange", "h": 0.011490376124743525}, {"w": 0.12343470255533862, "x": 0.5688729901579299, "text": "and black stripes.", "y": 0.27560469280991867, "h": 0.012709260417235805}, {"w": 0.010733451843261688, "h": 0.008851743820341854, "x": 0.5491949913413388, "text": "3", "y": 0.30854651170011255}, {"text": "This is an intelligent animal that lives in the sea.", "x": 0.5635062706172317, "y": 0.3085465118471961, "h": 0.0114218995674423, "w": 0.33273701985677084}, {"text": "Sometimes, it looks like it's smiling!", "y": 0.3223240073365179, "w": 0.24150268554687504, "h": 0.011513201768647938, "x": 0.5706618927364014}, {"w": 0.35957065158420143, "y": 0.3540697675884388, "h": 0.01144016038209523, "text": "4 This animal lives in the forest. It has long legs and", "x": 0.5491949998071837}, {"w": 0.2790697564019097, "h": 0.01149494132840683, "text": "is usually brown. Its babies are very cute!", "y": 0.367865523464259, "x": 0.5706619045539646}, {"x": 0.5491949913115236, "w": 0.010733451843261688, "text": "5", "y": 0.40085755817485813, "h": 0.008851743820341854}, {"h": 0.011394509094286404, "text": "This is the biggest animal on Earth. It lives in the sea", "x": 0.5599284471820611, "y": 0.4008438627847165, "w": 0.3667262776692709}, {"h": 0.009034348222753223, "x": 0.5706619014277554, "text": "but it isn't a fish. There are different kinds - Blue", "w": 0.32737030029296876, "y": 0.41458483760297}, {"y": 0.4286773257374578, "w": 0.33273701985677084, "x": 0.5706619056798434, "h": 0.011426464771105413, "text": "(the biggest), Killer (it is black and white and also"}, {"h": 0.010244101733507266, "y": 0.4424593864296117, "x": 0.5706619039300039, "text": "called an Orca) and others.", "w": 0.18425759209526915}, {"y": 0.47420058158069434, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "x": 0.5474060842010394, "text": "6 This is a dangerous kind of large fish. The Great", "w": 0.34883721245659727}, {"y": 0.48800090263322493, "h": 0.010225841293266157, "x": 0.570661897014446, "w": 0.34704830593532987, "text": "White is the most famous. The film Jaws was about"}, {"text": "one of these.", "x": 0.570643668202577, "w": 0.09127080281575528, "h": 0.01152760988538448, "y": 0.5019469507292533}, {"text": "7 This creature lives on the land but is a very good", "x": 0.5474060864812031, "w": 0.35241502549913195, "h": 0.011558852682044748, "y": 0.5347202167617838}, {"w": 0.34704830593532987, "h": 0.011431029974768718, "x": 0.5706618978820666, "y": 0.5488081396909462, "text": "swimmer. It's got very big teeth which it uses to cut"}, {"h": 0.012955776173285189, "x": 0.5688729862324617, "y": 0.5625947656028772, "text": "trees and build its home.", "w": 0.1717352464463976}, {"text": "8", "y": 0.5943313954519879, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.014311270183987146, "x": 0.54382826463967}, {"y": 0.5943313957736133, "x": 0.5635062669834332, "text": "This is the fastest animal in the world on land", "w": 0.31305901421440974, "h": 0.011449290040598003}, {"h": 0.01148581092108022, "w": 0.3452593994140626, "text": "It's a cat and it lives in Africa. There are black spots", "x": 0.5688729834101423, "y": 0.6081362817248196}, {"h": 0.013020559906529226, "text": "on its body.", "x": 0.5688172574720154, "y": 0.6232280921182232, "w": 0.0841901736789279}, {"h": 0.01162790690711013, "text": "It's about 80 metres high and it's a beautiful sight.", "x": 0.12551440772904318, "y": 0.8735465116142743, "w": 0.3415637885199653}, {"text": "7 I think Africa is the hottest c", "x": 0.10493827155232585, "y": 0.8865777079169322, "w": 0.21604938083224826, "h": 0.011773940345368938}, {"text": "t in the world.", "y": 0.8880813955482751, "w": 0.10493826972113718, "h": 0.010270252706866101, "x": 0.3724279857927235}, {"x": 0.12731577200743313, "text": "Am I right?", "h": 0.01343751515099545, "w": 0.07664417690700956, "y": 0.9002579867650188}, {"x": 0.08641975373373688, "w": 0.0246913570827908, "h": 0.01162790690711002, "y": 0.9331395348562457, "text": "96"}]